OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers quickly fading this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving a dry night with
OL,8,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells.
OL,9,FA mild night to come with a few mist
OL,10,Fpatches developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,13,FTuesday, turning somewhat cloudier
OL,14,Fthrough the day. A few showers then
OL,15,Fdeveloping by the afternoon, but many
OL,16,Fplaces remaining dry.
