OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining changeable with a band of
OL,7,Frain crossing the region on Wednesday.
OL,8,FTurning drier and brighter Thursday
OL,9,Fand Friday, with some light rain
OL,10,Fpossible Thursday evening.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
